From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] urlmon: ParseUrl actions, foreign IUri support, IsValidURL, MIME helpers, CopyStgMedium

urlmon: CoInternetParseUrl actions (FRIENDLY, DOCUMENT, ANCHOR, LOCATION,
SITE, URL_FROM_PATH, DECODE, ESCAPE, MIME, SERVER), IUri objects from
other implementations in IsEqual, CoInternetCombineIUri/UrlEx,
CoInternetParseIUri and the IUriBuilder entry points (copied into a
urlmon Uri first), IsValidURL, RegisterMediaTypes, GetClassFileOrMime and
CopyStgMedium for GDI, metafile and enhanced metafile media.
